9. She attended the Hodo Hodo Festival, which was her first experience at such an event, and found it exciting but physically draining. (Verbatim: "I went to hodo hodo festival... i've never been to anything like that before so that was also very very exciting but also... standing and walking and moving and queuing... takes a lot of energy.")

10. She extended her stay in Japan beyond her original plans and expresses a desire to stay forever. (Verbatim: "I did extend my stay... why don't i stay in japan forever that would be nice wouldn't it.") [end of text]



